{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1177646-help-me-craft-an-intro","id":1177646,"title":"Help me craft an intro?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-20T11:28:16-08:00","id":1177646,"title":"Help me craft an intro?","content":"I am hosting my very first attempt at a Werewolf chronicle and one of my players wants to be a Get of Fenris Metis. Outside of the main plotline, I have some ideas for the events of his childhood that we will roleplay and I was hoping some of the most experienced players here could tell me if these were things that might have happened to a metis that grew up in Scandinavia, in a Get of Fenris only sept and, perhaps, make suggestions of their own.<br /> <br /> He will inadvertently harm a kinfolk, possibly a nanny or playmate because what he has at the end of his arms cause aggravated damage.<br /> Part of his training will include being fighting against multiple older, more experienced Garou at the same time, having certain bones broken that he must heal in a specific order to control his regenerative abilities while being taught the lore of Fenris. If he performs well, he'll be given a brand of honor somewhere on his fur.<br /> He will fall for a kinfolk girl and he will have hi First Change into Homid because he desperately wants to be closer to her.<br /> He will attend a moot during which a much more powerful Garou will challenge him for the Kinfolk's affection and the impression given will be that he was set up to lose because the Elders didn't want a fertile Kinfolk wasted on a sterile Metis.<br /> <br /> This should all be part of his intro before he meets the Homids of the other players. What do you think, have I misunderstood the practices of the Get of Fenris?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-20T13:16:18-08:00","id":1177667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HardestadtTheEvenYounger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1177646-help-me-craft-an-intro#post1177646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He will inadvertently harm a kinfolk, possibly a nanny or playmate because what he has at the end of his arms cause aggravated damage.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">While it is one idea to have kinfolk nanny, this is not likely for the fenrir, probably raised by another Metis or an Adren Fenrir, even a Fostern as Rank challenge, to grow a metis cub and turn him true Fenrir, so there might be a good chance to gain a Mentor as well <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> Now killing the Mother of another pre-change teenager Garou, or that killing being the reason of another Garou to go under his first change and become enemies with the Metis pc is another idea.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HardestadtTheEvenYounger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1177646-help-me-craft-an-intro#post1177646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Part of his training will include being fighting against multiple older, more experienced Garou at the same time, having certain bones broken that he must heal in a specific order to control his regenerative abilities while being taught the lore of Fenris. If he performs well, he'll be given a brand of honor somewhere on his fur.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">The Metis doesn't need to learn how to control his regenerating cabapilities,thiis capability is inborn to Metis, more likely to control his Rage until he learns how to change shapes.<br /> Fighting against cliaths that are full fenrir or his mentor, who while the most times is caring yet distant and unfeeling, when he takes the cub for fighting he turns to be his worst nightmare.<br /> Like throwing him from a high cliff after a bloody and painful beatting.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HardestadtTheEvenYounger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1177646-help-me-craft-an-intro#post1177646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He will fall for a kinfolk girl and he will have hi First Change into Homid because he desperately wants to be closer to her.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Thats agood way to keep the player emotional and learn why being Metis is a terrible thing. Make his Garou enemy (the he killed his mother) steal this love of his.<br /> If you use that element.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HardestadtTheEvenYounger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1177646-help-me-craft-an-intro#post1177646\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He will attend a moot during which a much more powerful Garou will challenge him for the Kinfolk's affection and the impression given will be that he was set up to lose because the Elders didn't want a fertile Kinfolk wasted on a sterile Metis.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Using a ''much more powerful Garou'' is poor choice, make it emotional, (see above), or even a full fenrir member cliath who simply doesn't like him. Orchestrated by his mentor in order to teach him a hard life lesson.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> Now if he wins the fight, the girl could still be disgusted by him, what is his deformity ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 01-20-2018, 04:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-20T13:57:41-08:00","id":1177676,"title":"","content":"His deformity is albinism coupled with a pair of horns (which killed his mother during birth) so, I haven't decided yet whether it would be better storytelling to have this be a kinfolk young woman who can look past it or who was just being nice because it's what Kinfolk are supposed to do.<br /> <br /> I really like your idea of this cliath with an understandable vendetta against him and I think I will use it combined with the mentor. Have this player kill a Kinfolk woman that was taking care of him which prompts her son to Change. Then give him a Mentor who is during most of the time distant and who will pit him against this orphaned cliath but who will, occasionally, tell him tales of Fenrir's battle with Wotan. Then have the cliath be the one who face him during the moot for the girl.<br /> Thank you for the suggestion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-20T14:18:11-08:00","id":1177682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i><b> albinism coupled with a pair of horns</b></i> </div> </div> </div>This sounds like a promising metis hero. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It would be nice to think a background for this girl, is she the daughter of a Renowned Garou ? Is she trained by her father to be a viking girl ?<br /> Is she aware of the Fenrir society ? What about the Metis condition ? Your PC will look sick, pale with blood red eyes, but with good appearance and charisma he might look cute, and these horns girls cannot resist <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.<br /> <br /> She may think he is special, and maybe he is and she noticed. Their relationship should be roleplayed and keep in secret how she truly feels about him till the drama escalates. Seeing two Garou fighting is a terrifying sight that can make people see nightmares for years, even kinfolk. Even if he does win and she sees the gory side of the Garou society she migh get scared away.<br /> <br /> Give a thought on whith what colours you want to paint this dramatic romance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}